# Node.js secure random implementation (the host node:crypto module). randomBytes returns a Buffer; render it as hex text. Internal: reached only through the public random API.

dock load
  load <node:crypto>, name crypto

task random-bytes
  take size, like number
  like text
  save raw
    call crypto/random-bytes
      read size
  send back
    call raw/to-string
      text <hex>
